      "text": "SUMMARY\nSara Lindqvist is a Senior Product Manager with 8.0 years of experience in product strategy, roadmapping,\nand data analytics. Based in Stockholm, Sweden, Sara has applied agile methodologies and user testing\nacross cloud computing and digital media industries. Educational background includes a bachelor degree in\nbusiness administration from Stockholm University."
