    {
      "id": "sara-lindqvist:experience:1",
      "section": "experience",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "EXPERIENCE\nSenior Product Manager — Fjall Cloud Systems Jun 2021 – Present\nIndustry: Cloud Computing\n• Executed Product Strategy and Roadmapping for cloud infrastructure tools.\n• Applied Agile Methodologies and Data Analytics in the Cloud Computing industry.\nProduct Manager — Barken Media Sep 2018 – May 2021\nIndustry: Digital Media\n• Conducted Market Research and User Testing within Digital Media.\n• Leveraged Product Strategy and Agile Methodologies to deliver products."
